# Kya cheez builder tak JATI HI NAHI.
#
# 🔴 Ye file na hone se har deploy poora repo Fly ke builder par bhejta tha — us mein
# local Postgres ka data (.local, ~67MB) aur render preview ki tasveerein bhi shaamil
# thin. Us se do nuqsan hote the: har deploy dheema, aur bara context bhejte waqt
# builder ka connection toot jata tha ("failed to receive status: rpc error ... EOF").
#
# Docker khud `COPY` par sirf wohi leta hai jo maanga jaye, magar CONTEXT poora upload
# hota hai — is liye jo cheez image mein nahi jani, wo yahan likhni parti hai.

# Install image ke andar hota hai (pnpm-lock se), bahar se bhejne ka koi faida nahi
node_modules
**/node_modules

.git
.github

# Local Postgres ka data — `pnpm db:local` banata hai
.local

# Build ke natije — image ke andar naye sire se bante hain
**/.next
**/.next-local
**/dist
**/.turbo

# Render preview ki tasveerein (`render:preview`)
apps/worker/preview-out

# 🔴 Secrets kabhi image mein nahi — live par ye Fly ke secrets se aate hain
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.secrets

*.log
